@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Login para obter o token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "teste123"
}

### Criar viagem
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Férias no Chile",
  "destination": "Santiago",
  "start_date": "2026-03-15",
  "end_date": "2026-03-22"
}

### Listar viagens
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Criar sem token — espera 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sem token",
  "destination": "Lugar nenhum",
  "start_date": "2026-03-15",
  "end_date": "2026-03-22"
}

### Criar com data de fim antes do início — espera 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Datas trocadas",
  "destination": "Santiago",
  "start_date": "2026-03-22",
  "end_date": "2026-03-15"
}